{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-7-e28","title":"钟邕随钟会俱死","order":5820,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-7-e28","label":"正文","text":"钟邕随钟会俱死","evidence":["wgc-q0507","wgc-q0082"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0052","role":"随会与俱死","evidence":["wgc-q0507","wgc-q0082"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0507","wgc-q0082"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0507"}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0052","name":"钟邕","evidence":["wgc-q0082"],"aliases":[],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wgc-m-o112-wgc-p0052","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及钟邕","evidence":["wgc-q0082"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0082","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-bab760e79c090fdc0e1d","layer":"original","quote":"会兄毓，以四年冬薨〖1〗；会竟未知问〖2〗。会兄子邕，随会与俱死。会所养兄子毅及峻、辿﹝一﹞等下狱，当伏诛。司马文王表天子下诏曰：“峻等祖父繇，三祖之世，极位台司〖3〗；佐命立勋，飨食庙庭〖4〗。父毓，历职内外，干事有绩。昔楚思子文之治〖5〗，不灭鬭氏之祀；晋录成、宣之忠〖6〗，用存赵氏之后。以会、邕之罪，而绝繇、毓之类，吾有愍然！峻、辿兄弟特原，有官爵者如故。惟毅及邕息伏法〖7〗。”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":595,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":194,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0507","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-bab760e79c090fdc0e1d","layer":"original","quote":"会兄子邕，随会与俱死","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":595,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
